                      written: "5 uH"
                  range: Optional.empty
                  step: Optional.empty
                  flags: List(0)
                  description: "what is left once the core is saturated: the winding's air-core inductance. An approximation — a datasheet gives ISAT as a 30 % drop, not this floor"
                  values: List(0)
              - Parameter
